  "description": "Fast MessagePack (MsgPack) serializer for .NET classes, used like the JSON serializers: 3-5x as fast as System.Text.Json with 35-47% smaller payloads. Polymorphism with type ids, an optional indexed schema, data of older and newer class versions still loads, streaming, presets for MessagePack-CSharp and Nerdbank.MessagePack, and a source generator for NativeAOT and trimming.",
